# Toast POS

> Toast is a restaurant point of sale and management system that helps restaurants improve operations, increase sales and create a better guest experience.

## Restaurants

### Service models

- [Quick Service POS System](https://pos.toasttab.com/restaurant-pos/quick-service-pos-system): Toast POS features for quick service restaurants include guest-facing display for counter service, integrated online ordering synced with the terminal.
- [Full Service POS System](https://pos.toasttab.com/restaurant-pos/full-service-pos-system): Toast POS features for full service restaurants include our kitchen display system, Toast Go® 2 handheld, online ordering and Toast Mobile Order and PayTM.
- [Fast Casual POS System](https://pos.toasttab.com/restaurant-pos/fast-casual): Toast POS features for fast casual restaurants include guest-facing display for counter service, integrated online ordering synced with the terminal.

